OL,3,GNEWSACalls for changes to Oxford's     
OL,4,Atraffic filters                        
OL,6,FPressure is growing on a local         
OL,7,Fauthority to make changes to a scheme  
OL,8,Fintended to ease congestion in a city  
OL,9,Fcentre.                                
OL,11,FOxford's traffic filters were          
OL,12,Fintroduced at the end of September,    
OL,13,Fbanning cars from driving through six  
OL,14,Fpoints in the city, unless the driver  
OL,15,Fhas a permit.                          
OL,17,FThe Labour group on Oxford City Council
OL,18,Fsaid it supports the scheme but would  
OL,19,Flike to see people living in the city  
OL,20,F"fully exempt" as well as a review of  
OL,21,Fthe positioning and timings of the     
OL,22,Ffilters.                               
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
