OL,3,GNEWSACalls for changes to Oxford's     
OL,4,Atraffic filters                        
OL,6,FOxfordshire County Council is due to   
OL,7,Fpublish the first round of monitoring  
OL,8,Fdata on the programme early next week. 
OL,9,FLiberal Democrat leader Tim Bearder    
OL,10,Fsaid they are constantly reviewing the 
OL,11,Fprogramme and "looking to make         
OL,12,Fchanges".                              
